      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been running with the Uncompressed Size limit of 500mb. Ran into a surprising amount of avatars that exceeded this.\n\nI've noticed that most of these avatars have less than 100mb file size (with 2 hitting >600mb with an under 50mb file). This suggests that uncompressed size will be the dominant limit a PC avatar would hit.\n\nBut what about Quest? It's much easier to hit the file limit on Quest, will the uncompressed end up being a new (and stricter) limit then the current file size? how many current quest avatars exist now that exceed the proposed limit?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
